# Write a file named .env.secrets.anubis containing a single line: a 64-char
# hex-encoded ed25519 private key, used by Anubis to sign challenge-pass
# cookies so they survive container restarts. Generate one with:
#   openssl rand -hex 32 > .env.secrets.anubis
# Each deployment target (dev/staging/prod) should generate its own; losing
# it just forces every visitor to redo the bot challenge once.
